Hougem
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
IYU 7 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
IYU 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
IYU 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE IYU IYU
AND
    DESTSRC Suit match
    SRC Rank 1
MOVE_STACK IYU IYU
OR
    DEST Suit {HEARTS, SPADES}
    AND
        DEST Empty
        SRCSTACK Size > 4
$win
AND
    OR
        PILE ALL IYU Empty
        PILE ALL IYU Empty
    OR
        PILE ALL IYU Empty
        PILE ALL IYU Empty
